<title>FINLAND: FINNISH JAN WHOLESALES VOLUME RISES 2.8 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH JAN WHOLESALES VOLUME RISES 2.8 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of Finnish wholesales rose 2.8 percent year-on-year in January and the value excluding VAT of these sales rose 5.3 percent, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The volume of retail sales rose 4.0 percent and the value excluding VAT of those sales rose 4.2 percent from the year-ago period, SF said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
